    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access to 1.0 Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/ff2fd556bea6868c2499d87441927fc2.avif?t=1750355661\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fd2982f044d0f8528d37691a7906d201.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fd2982f044d0f8528d37691a7906d201.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/72547fddf80d18adeb8e113ad49a433e.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm the solo developer of Seeds of Calamity. I've always loved farming sims, and one day I thought, 'What the hell, I could make one too.' So I did! Seeds of Calamity is a peaceful, slow-paced game designed to fit your playstyle. From vibrant pixel-art visuals to a relaxing day-to-day rhythm, it offers a warm and welcoming experience. Whether you're exploring, farming, or helping out your neighbors, every moment is crafted with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fafbc9c60881efe216af43edb441b42d.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fafbc9c60881efe216af43edb441b42d.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a quiet wayside village you\u2019d pass by in a classic JRPG \u2013 you and your fluffy Spellbook Companion tend your farm, help the community, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/efd57b2e65a0294fae577815d853f974.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty years after the Great Calamity, the land is finally recovering. As a young adventurer, you\u2019ll leave the bustling capital to settle in a quiet village on the frontier. Here, you\u2019ll build a cozy farm, help your neighbors, and uncover the small joys of life in a world healing from its past.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/03da33bfbe4c3056190e3bd215b7aa99.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/03da33bfbe4c3056190e3bd215b7aa99.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/ea28f3e053826dbd8b3b976e76e6ce27.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div>Tend crops, raise animals, and craft tools to grow your farm through the seasons! Help rebuild by sending resources to the capital and supporting your community. Celebrate the post-Calamity world with festivals, from harvest feasts to moonlit gatherings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/300e9f0212085fdf79d22d8ac4a38940.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/300e9f0212085fdf79d22d8ac4a38940.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e28ca88c7bfe1bea914155af0c2e894.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e28ca88c7bfe1bea914155af0c2e894.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the village, dungeons brimming with monsters, treasures, and artifacts await discovery. With the help of your Spellbook Companion, battle slimes and bosses in accessible, turn-based combat. Gather rare resources to improve your farm and unlock new possibilities for growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/e26dfd213e475377a95ce5c5fa6c4776.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/e26dfd213e475377a95ce5c5fa6c4776.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/8c383cef86a2af4fcf33f35720cb7a81.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/8c383cef86a2af4fcf33f35720cb7a81.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spellbook Companion is your constant ally, guiding you through your journey. This magical friend helps you uncover hidden treasures, catalog recipes and quests, and even casts spells in battle. It\u2019s more than a companion \u2013 it\u2019s an essential part of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/b1f81d8757487fb30537d80111f07267.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/b1f81d8757487fb30537d80111f07267.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e2d79db7e0b8184fe78285bc09e2893.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeds of Calamity is designed with inclusivity in mind, featuring extensive accessibility options. Adjust controls, length of day, colors, difficulty, visuals, and more to ensure the game feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into a world rebuilding from its past, one crop, friendship, and adventure at a time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fd2982f044d0f8528d37691a7906d201.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fd2982f044d0f8528d37691a7906d201.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/72547fddf80d18adeb8e113ad49a433e.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm the solo developer of Seeds of Calamity. I've always loved farming sims, and one day I thought, 'What the hell, I could make one too.' So I did! Seeds of Calamity is a peaceful, slow-paced game designed to fit your playstyle. From vibrant pixel-art visuals to a relaxing day-to-day rhythm, it offers a warm and welcoming experience. Whether you're exploring, farming, or helping out your neighbors, every moment is crafted with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fafbc9c60881efe216af43edb441b42d.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/fafbc9c60881efe216af43edb441b42d.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a quiet wayside village you\u2019d pass by in a classic JRPG \u2013 you and your fluffy Spellbook Companion tend your farm, help the community, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/efd57b2e65a0294fae577815d853f974.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty years after the Great Calamity, the land is finally recovering. As a young adventurer, you\u2019ll leave the bustling capital to settle in a quiet village on the frontier. Here, you\u2019ll build a cozy farm, help your neighbors, and uncover the small joys of life in a world healing from its past.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/03da33bfbe4c3056190e3bd215b7aa99.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/03da33bfbe4c3056190e3bd215b7aa99.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/ea28f3e053826dbd8b3b976e76e6ce27.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div>Tend crops, raise animals, and craft tools to grow your farm through the seasons! Help rebuild by sending resources to the capital and supporting your community. Celebrate the post-Calamity world with festivals, from harvest feasts to moonlit gatherings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/300e9f0212085fdf79d22d8ac4a38940.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/300e9f0212085fdf79d22d8ac4a38940.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e28ca88c7bfe1bea914155af0c2e894.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e28ca88c7bfe1bea914155af0c2e894.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the village, dungeons brimming with monsters, treasures, and artifacts await discovery. With the help of your Spellbook Companion, battle slimes and bosses in accessible, turn-based combat. Gather rare resources to improve your farm and unlock new possibilities for growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/e26dfd213e475377a95ce5c5fa6c4776.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/e26dfd213e475377a95ce5c5fa6c4776.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/8c383cef86a2af4fcf33f35720cb7a81.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/8c383cef86a2af4fcf33f35720cb7a81.apng?t=1750355661\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spellbook Companion is your constant ally, guiding you through your journey. This magical friend helps you uncover hidden treasures, catalog recipes and quests, and even casts spells in battle. It\u2019s more than a companion \u2013 it\u2019s an essential part of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/b1f81d8757487fb30537d80111f07267.poster.avif?t=1750355661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/b1f81d8757487fb30537d80111f07267.webm?t=1750355661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/6e2d79db7e0b8184fe78285bc09e2893.webp?t=1750355661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeds of Calamity is designed with inclusivity in mind, featuring extensive accessibility options. Adjust controls, length of day, colors, difficulty, visuals, and more to ensure the game feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into a world rebuilding from its past, one crop, friendship, and adventure at a time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Take part in healing after the Great Calamity. Tend your farm, complete quests for the villagers, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure in this cozy, solo-developed farming sim. Build a new life in a recovering world with your fluffy Spellbook Companion.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis game has a level of polish and QOL features you would expect from a full release, hard to believe this is early access.\u201d<br>LeChiefe<br><br>\u201cIt's just so cozy, so simple, so elegant, The gameplay is very immersive. [...] I had trouble tearing myself away [from the game].\u201d<br>Kitamarie Plays<br><br>\u201cYou can tell there's definitely love that went into it. I love all the accessibility features and lots of little details.\u201d<br>Josh's Gaming Garden<br>",
